error[T-Extern]: `named_name_of_address` answers memory `handle` lends, so `handle` must be a handle or a `std.ffi` view, and `UInt64` is neither
  --> tests/ffi/a_view_borrows_only_from_a_handle/named/named.lin:12:33
   |
12 | extern fn named_name_of_address(handle: UInt64) -> ffi.CText where borrows(handle)
   |                                 ^^^^^^ take a handle: a type sealed with `@opaque` in a module trusted with C and not `copyable`; or write `where carries()` when C keeps the memory for the program's life
